# Gossip, debts and promises, the people one deals with (priest, shopkeeper, leader, neighbour), the realm's figures,
# and the town's news (theme n7). Each opener remembers what it was about (conv.on, and its own key), the other
# answers as they are and remembers how they took it, and the opener has the last word (town.close).
#
# Gossip: topic.claim is the claim's words after the name, as claims.json says them ("died", "married Wren Ashdown",
# "tried to steal from Hild"...), and topic.claim_kind what kind of thing it is (death, marriage, theft, violence, victim,
# wanted, newcomer...: doc 84, Phase 1). Answers are keyed on the kind, never the words: a thief is not called on to
# "see how they are" (defect 7).

## Gossip, told as the teller is (talk.gossip: topic.subject, topic.claim)

rule n7_go_sly
when concept=talk.gossip self.honesty=sly
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} I shouldn't say. But I will. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} Now, you didn't hear this from me: #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} I know something you don't. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Worth a drink, that.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_chatty
when concept=talk.gossip self.talk=chatty
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} Oh, you'll love this. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#! | {on=gossip} Sit down, sit down. You'll never guess. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} Have you heard? You haven't! #topic.subject# #topic.claim#!
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_devout
when concept=talk.gossip self.piety=devout
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} I don't hold with tattle. But you ought to know. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} I'll say it once and say no more: #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} It was all the talk after chapel. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_quiet
when concept=talk.gossip self.talk=quiet
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. That's all I'll say. | {on=gossip} Heard something. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, they say. | {on=gossip} Mm. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Thought you'd want to know.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_nervy
when concept=talk.gossip self.temper=nervy
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} Don't look round. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I'm not saying it's true. | {on=gossip} I'm only saying what I heard. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Don't tell anyone I said. | {on=gossip} Is anyone listening? Right. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_neighbours
when concept=talk.gossip pair.neighbours=yes
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} The whole row's talking. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} Over the back wall this morning: #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} You'll not have heard, you were out. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_chapel
when concept=talk.gossip here.place=chapel
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} Not here. Well, quickly: #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} The whole back pew knows. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} Lean in. Quietly. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_tavern
when concept=talk.gossip here.place=tavern
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} Lean in. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Straight from behind the bar. | {on=gossip} Another jug and I'll tell you. No, I'll tell you now: #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} The whole room's buzzing. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_old
when concept=talk.gossip self.stage=old
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} I've seen a lot of years, and this one's new to me. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} You young ones won't credit it. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} Now then. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. What do you make of that?
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_young
when concept=talk.gossip self.stage=young|adolescent
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} #mum# says #topic.subject# #topic.claim#! Is that bad? | {on=gossip} The big pups at the well say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} I heard the grown-ups. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#! I'm not supposed to know.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_servant
when concept=talk.gossip self.job=servant
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} You hear things, serving at table. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} The household's talked of nothing else. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} They forget we've ears. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_guard
when concept=talk.gossip self.role=guard
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} I shouldn't, being the Watch. But #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} It came up at the watch post. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} Word among the Watch: #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_merchant
when concept=talk.gossip self.role=merchant here.place=market|work
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} Every customer today, same story. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} Sold more gossip than goods this morning. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} A counter hears everything. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_rivals
when concept=talk.gossip pair.band=rivals
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} I suppose even you should hear this. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} Thought you'd know already, you know everything. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} Here's something you didn't know first: #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_spouses
when concept=talk.gossip pair.band=spouses
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} #dear.capitalize#, you'll never guess. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} Don't make that face. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | {on=gossip} Guess what I heard at the well. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_married
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=marriage
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} #topic.subject#'s married! Did you know? | {on=gossip} Well, #topic.subject#'s gone and married. | {on=gossip} Wedding bells for #topic.subject#. Who'd have thought it?
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_died
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=death
priority 10
does tell.gossip
tone grave
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} Did you hear? #topic.subject# died. | {on=gossip} #topic.subject#'s gone. Died, they said. I can't take it in. | {on=gossip} They're saying #topic.subject# died. Is it true?
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_died_old
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=death self.stage=old
does tell.gossip
tone grave
priority 10
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} #topic.subject#'s gone. Another one. They're dropping like leaves this year. | {on=gossip} Have you heard about #topic.subject#? Died. I'd have bet on me going first. | {on=gossip} #topic.subject# died. I remember #topic.them# as a pup, tumbling in the street.
then other: town.gossip

rule n7_go_died_warm
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=death self.warmth=warm
does tell.gossip
tone grave
priority 10
cooldown 1d
say {on=gossip} Oh, have you heard? #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# died. I can't stop thinking about it. | {on=gossip} I've had sad news. #topic.subject# died. | {on=gossip} It's #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize#'s died. I keep wanting to go round with a pie.
then other: town.gossip

## Hearing it (self is the one told)

rule n7_ga2_plain
when concept=town.gossip
does react.news.doubt
say {ha=plain} #topic.subject#? Never. | {ha=plain} Who told you that? | {ha=plain} Well, I never. | {ha=plain} Is that so? Well, well.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_plain2
when concept=town.gossip
does react.news.new
say #surprise#. | Huh. Fancy that. | Hm. | Mm.

rule n7_ga2_frank
when concept=town.gossip self.honesty=frank
does react.news.doubt
say {ha=doubt} I'll ask #topic.subject# myself, then. | {ha=doubt} I'll believe it when I hear it from #topic.subject#. | {ha=doubt} Then I'll hear it from #topic.subject#, not from the well.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_guarded
when concept=town.gossip self.honesty=guarded
does react.news
say {ha=hush} I'd not repeat that, if I were you. | {ha=hush} Hm. I'll keep that to myself. | {ha=hush} I didn't hear it. Nor did you.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_sly
when concept=town.gossip self.honesty=sly topic.claim_kind!=death|violence|victim
does ask.detail
say {ha=eager} And? There's always more. What else? | {ha=eager} Interesting. Who else knows? | {ha=eager} That's worth knowing. Thank you. Very much.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_chatty
when concept=town.gossip self.talk=chatty topic.claim_kind!=death|violence|victim
does react.news.glee
say {ha=eager} No! Wait till I tell my sister. | {ha=eager} I knew it! Didn't I say? I said! | {ha=eager} Tell me everything. Slowly. From the start.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_warm
when concept=town.gossip self.warmth=warm topic.claim_kind=victim|newcomer|other
does react.news.sorrow
say {ha=kind} Oh. Well, I hope #topic.they#'s all right, whatever's what. | {ha=kind} I'll call on #topic.subject#. See how #topic.they# is. | {ha=kind} We shouldn't talk. But oh, #topic.subject#.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_cold
when concept=town.gossip self.warmth=cold topic.claim_kind!=death
does react.news
say {ha=cold} Not my business. | {ha=cold} #bc_and_q# | {ha=cold} Doesn't surprise me.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_devout
when concept=town.gossip self.piety=devout topic.claim_kind!=marriage|death
does counter
say {ha=pious} The gods hear tattle too, you know. | {ha=pious} Judge not. Well. A little. | {ha=pious} I'll pray for #topic.subject#. And for us, for listening.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_guard
when concept=town.gossip self.role=guard topic.claim_kind=theft|violence|wanted|prowling|promise_broken|newcomer
does react.news
say {ha=plain} I'll keep an ear open. | {ha=plain} I'll make a note of that. | {ha=plain} Hm. I'll keep my eye on #topic.subject#.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_priest
when concept=town.gossip self.job=priest topic.claim_kind!=marriage|death
does counter
say {ha=pious} I'll not hear it. And nor should you. | {ha=pious} If #topic.subject# needs help, I'll go. If not, I'll not hear another word. | {ha=pious} Words are stones. Be careful where you throw them.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_old
when concept=town.gossip self.stage=old topic.claim_kind!=death|violence|victim
does react.news.known
say {ha=plain} I've heard it all in my time. Most of it twice. | {ha=plain} It'll be forgotten by the next festival. Everything is. | {ha=plain} Ha. Their grandmother was just the same.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_young
when concept=town.gossip self.stage=young topic.claim_kind!=death|violence|victim
does ask.detail
say {ha=pup} What does that mean? | {ha=pup} Is that bad? It sounds bad. | {ha=pup} I'm telling everyone!
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_dry
when concept=town.gossip self.humour=dry topic.claim_kind!=death|violence|victim
does react.news.doubt
say {ha=doubt} And the moon's made of cheese, I suppose. | {ha=doubt} Gossip travels fast. The truth's still putting its boots on. | {ha=doubt} Fascinating. Tell me again, slower, so I can not believe it properly.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_merry
when concept=town.gossip self.humour=merry topic.claim_kind!=death|violence|victim
does react.news.glee
say {ha=eager} Ha! No! | {ha=eager} Oh, that's too good. Is it true? Don't tell me. Tell me. | {ha=eager} Ha! I'll never look at #topic.subject# the same.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_nervy
when concept=town.gossip self.temper=nervy topic.claim_kind!=death|violence|victim
does react.news
say {ha=hush} Don't. If they hear we said it... | {ha=hush} Shh! Not so loud. | {ha=hush} Oh, I wish you hadn't told me. Now I'll have to not tell people.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_married
when concept=town.gossip topic.claim_kind=marriage
does react.news.glad
say {ha=glad} Good for them. | {ha=glad} Married! Well, well. Who to? | {ha=glad} About time, I'd say. | {ha=glad} Married? I'll believe it when I see the cake.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_married_warm
when concept=town.gossip topic.claim_kind=marriage self.warmth=warm
does react.news
say {ha=glad} Oh, that's lovely. I'll take them something. | {ha=glad} Bless them. Bless them both. | {ha=glad} Oh! I do love a wedding.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_married_dry
when concept=town.gossip topic.claim_kind=marriage self.humour=dry
does react.news
say {ha=glad} Married. They'll learn. | {ha=glad} Brave souls, the pair of them. | {ha=glad} Married. Well. Somebody had to.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_death
when concept=town.gossip topic.claim_kind=death
priority 3
does react.news.sorrow
tone grave
say {ha=dead} Gods. I'd no idea. | {ha=dead} No. Not #topic.them#. Surely not. | {ha=dead} Dead? #topic.subject#? Oh, that's hard.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_death_devout
when concept=town.gossip topic.claim_kind=death self.piety=devout
does react.news
priority 3
say {ha=dead} The Bright One keep #topic.them#. I'll light a candle tonight. | {ha=dead} May #topic.they# find rest. | {ha=dead} We'll pray for #topic.them# at Restday. All of us.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_death_old
when concept=town.gossip topic.claim_kind=death self.stage=old
does react.news
priority 3
say {ha=dead} They go so fast now. All of them. | {ha=dead} It's never the right ones. | {ha=dead} Another. I'll be next, mark me.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga2_death_cold
when concept=town.gossip topic.claim_kind=death self.warmth=cold
does react.news
priority 3
say {ha=dead} Hm. Everyone goes. | {ha=dead} I hardly knew #topic.them#. | {ha=dead} Well. That's that.
then other: town.close

## The last word on gossip (the teller; conv.ha says how it was taken)

rule n7_close_go
when concept=town.close conv.on=gossip
does ack
say Well. That's what they're saying. | I'm only telling you what I heard. | Make of it what you like.

rule n7_close_go_doubt
when concept=town.close conv.on=gossip conv.ha=doubt
does insist
say Suit yourself. You'll see. | Believe what you like. I know what I heard. | Ask anyone.

rule n7_close_go_hush
when concept=town.close conv.on=gossip conv.ha=hush
does agree
say Not a word, then. | You're right. Forget I said it. | My lips are sealed. From now.

rule n7_close_go_eager
when concept=town.close conv.on=gossip conv.ha=eager
does answer.detail
say That's all I know. Honest. | I'll tell you the rest when I have it. | I knew you'd like that one.

rule n7_close_go_eager_sly
when concept=town.close conv.on=gossip conv.ha=eager self.honesty=sly
does ack
say There's more, but it'll cost you a drink. | Keep it close. It's worth more that way. | Remember: you heard it here first.

rule n7_close_go_kind
when concept=town.close conv.on=gossip conv.ha=kind
does agree
say Aye. Let's hope so. | You're kinder than most. | You're right. We shouldn't.

rule n7_close_go_cold
when concept=town.close conv.on=gossip conv.ha=cold
does ack
say Please yourself. | I only thought you'd want to know. | Fine. I'll tell someone who cares.

rule n7_close_go_pious
when concept=town.close conv.on=gossip conv.ha=pious
does concede
say I know. I know. Gods forgive me. | I'll say no more of it. | You're right. I'll say a prayer for loose tongues. Mine first.

rule n7_close_go_pup
when concept=town.close conv.on=gossip conv.ha=pup
does counter
say Never you mind. And don't repeat it! | Hush now. Forget I said. | Not bad. Just grown-up business.

rule n7_close_go_glad
when concept=town.close conv.on=gossip conv.ha=glad
does assess
say There'll be a feast, I'd think. | It's nice to hear good news for once. | I'll find out who to, don't you worry.

rule n7_close_go_death
when concept=town.close conv.on=gossip conv.ha=dead
does agree
tone grave
say Aye. Gone, just like that. | I'll miss seeing them about. | It makes you think.

## Debts and promises between the two (pair.owed and pair.promise name the one who owes, the one who promised)

rule n7_db_dun
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day|talk.friends pair.owed=b
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {on=debt db=dun} About that money you owe me... | {on=debt db=dun} Not to rush you, but it's been a while. You know what I mean. | {on=debt db=dun} I don't like to ask. I'm asking.
then other: town.debt

rule n7_db_dun_short
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.owed=b self.temper=short
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {on=debt db=dun} Where's my money? | {on=debt db=dun} You owe me. Don't pretend you've forgotten. | {on=debt db=dun} I've been patient. I'm done being patient.
then other: town.debt

rule n7_db_dun_poor
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.owed=b self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
priority 1
say {on=debt db=dun} I'd not ask, but I need what you owe me. | {on=debt db=dun} I'm #skint#, #address#. Even a little of what you owe would help. | {on=debt db=dun} I've not eaten since yesterday. That money. Please.
then other: town.debt

rule n7_db_pay
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day|talk.friends pair.owed=a
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {on=debt db=pay} I've not forgotten what I owe you. Restday, I swear. | {on=debt db=pay} Here's some of it. The rest when I can. | {on=debt db=pay} I know, I know. I owe you. I've not forgotten.
then other: town.debt

rule n7_db_pay_sly
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.owed=a self.honesty=sly
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {on=debt db=flatter} Before you say anything: lovely day, isn't it? | {on=debt db=flatter} You're looking well! Very well! Prosperous, even. | {on=debt db=flatter} Friend! Old friend! Have I told you how much I value you?
then other: town.debt

rule n7_db_promise_due
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day|talk.friends pair.promise=b
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {on=debt db=promised} You said you'd give me a paw with the roof. | {on=debt db=promised} Still coming Restday, like you promised? | {on=debt db=promised} I'm holding you to your word, you know.
then other: town.debt

rule n7_db_promise_mine
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day|talk.friends pair.promise=a
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {on=debt db=promising} I've not forgotten my promise. I'll be round. | {on=debt db=promising} What I said I'd do, I'll do. Give me till Restday. | {on=debt db=promising} I gave you my word. That's that.
then other: town.debt

rule n7_db_word_bad
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.rumour=breaks_promises
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
priority 1
say {on=debt db=word_bad} Folk say your word's worth nothing. Tell me they're wrong. | {on=debt db=word_bad} I heard you let someone down. Badly. | {on=debt db=word_bad} They say if you promise something, start counting the days.
then other: town.debt

rule n7_db_word_good
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.rumour=keeps_promises
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=debt db=word_good} They say when you give your word it's iron. I need a wolf like that. | {on=debt db=word_good} I hear you're as good as your word. Rare, that. | {on=debt db=word_good} Folk say you keep your promises. Is that so?
then other: town.debt

rule n7_db_lend_ask
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.friends self.owes=yes pair.band=friends|family self.stage=adult|old
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=debt db=lend} You couldn't lend me a little? Only till Restday. | {on=debt db=lend} I'm in a hole, #pet#. A small loan would get me out. | {on=debt db=lend} I hate this. Could you spare me a few pennies?
then other: town.debt

rule n7_db_slate_ask
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.prices pair.customer=a self.wealth=poor|destitute
does request
cooldown 2d
say {on=debt db=slate} Could you put it on my slate? Just this week. | {on=debt db=slate} I'll pay Restday. Can I take it now? | {on=debt db=slate} You know I'm good for it. Mostly.
then other: town.debt

rule n7_db_slate_due
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.prices pair.customer=b other.owes=yes
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {on=debt db=slate_due} Your slate's getting long, #address#. | {on=debt db=slate_due} I've a tally here with your name on it. A long one. | {on=debt db=slate_due} I can't give more till something's paid off. I'm sorry.
then other: town.debt

## Answering about money and promises (each remembers its stance, conv.da)

rule n7_da_plain
when concept=town.debt
does react.self
say {da=promise} Aye. I know. | {da=promise} #bc_fair_enough# | {da=promise} Right. Restday, then.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_dun
when concept=town.debt conv.db=dun
does react.self
say {da=promise} Restday. I swear it. | {da=promise} I've not forgotten. Give me a few days. | {da=promise} I know. I'm ashamed. Month's end, every penny.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_dun_poor
when concept=town.debt conv.db=dun self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.self
say {da=plead} I've nothing. Take my coat, if you want it. | {da=plead} If I had it you'd have it. I swear. | {da=plead} Can you wait? Please. Just a little longer.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_dun_rich
when concept=town.debt conv.db=dun self.wealth=rich|comfortable
does react.self
say {da=paid} Is it so much? Here. Take it now and we'll say no more. | {da=paid} Gods, I'd forgotten entirely. How embarrassing. Here. | {da=paid} Of course. With something for the wait.
regard other: trust +1
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_dun_sly
when concept=town.debt conv.db=dun self.honesty=sly
does react.self
say {da=dodge} What money? Oh, that. Of course. Soon. | {da=dodge} I thought we'd agreed that was a gift. | {da=dodge} I paid you. Didn't I? I'm sure I did.
regard other: trust -1
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_dun_short
when concept=town.debt conv.db=dun self.temper=short
does react.self
say {da=bite} You'll get it when you get it. | {da=bite} Don't badger me in the street. | {da=bite} I said I'd pay. Stop asking.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_pay
when concept=town.debt conv.db=pay
does react.self
say {da=ease} I know you're good for it. | {da=ease} No rush. Well. Some rush. | {da=ease} That'll do. Pay when you can.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_pay_warm
when concept=town.debt conv.db=pay self.warmth=warm
does react.self
say {da=ease} Don't fret over it. Pay when you can. | {da=ease} Keep it a while. You need it more. | {da=ease} Friends first, money after.
regard other: affinity +1
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_pay_rich
when concept=town.debt conv.db=pay self.wealth=rich
does react.self
say {da=ease} Keep it. Buy yourself something hot. | {da=ease} It's nothing. Truly. Forget it. | {da=ease} Half, then, and we'll call it square.
regard other: affinity +1
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_pay_cold
when concept=town.debt conv.db=pay self.warmth=cold
does react.self
say {da=stern} See that you do. | {da=stern} I've written it down. | {da=stern} Restday. Not the one after.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_flatter
when concept=town.debt conv.db=flatter
does react.self ask.detail
say {da=stern} And my money? | {da=stern} Very nice. Where's what you owe me? | {da=stern} You only talk like that when you owe me.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_flatter_warm
when concept=town.debt conv.db=flatter self.warmth=warm
does react.self
say {da=ease} Ha. I know what you're doing. Pay me Restday and I'll forget it. | {da=ease} Flattery and no pennies. Typical. | {da=ease} Go on with you. I know you're good for it. Eventually.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_promised
when concept=town.debt conv.db=promised
does react.self
say {da=promise} I said I would and I will. | {da=promise} Restday. I've not forgotten. | {da=promise} My word's my word.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_promised_sly
when concept=town.debt conv.db=promised self.honesty=sly
does react.self
say {da=dodge} Did I say this Restday? | {da=dodge} Help, yes. I didn't say how much help. | {da=dodge} Something came up. Something will always come up, I'm afraid.
regard other: trust -1
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_promised_nervy
when concept=town.debt conv.db=promised self.temper=nervy
does react.self
say {da=promise} Oh gods. I forgot. I'm sorry. I'm so sorry. | {da=promise} I'll be there! I will! What day did I say? | {da=promise} I haven't forgotten. I had forgotten. I've remembered now.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_promising
when concept=town.debt conv.db=promising
does react.self
say {da=ease} I'll hold you to it. | {da=ease} Good. I'll have the kettle on. | {da=ease} Don't make me come looking.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_word_bad
when concept=town.debt conv.db=word_bad
does react.self
say {da=deny} They're wrong. | {da=deny} One time. One time, and the town never forgets. | {da=deny} Who's been talking?
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_word_bad_short
when concept=town.debt conv.db=word_bad self.temper=short
does react.self
say {da=bite} Say that again and see what I keep. | {da=bite} Who said that? Name them. | {da=bite} I keep my word to those who deserve it.
regard self: affinity -1
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_word_good
when concept=town.debt conv.db=word_good
does react.self
say {da=assure} I keep it when I can. What is it you need? | {da=assure} What I say, I do. Simple as that. | {da=assure} My father taught me. Say less, do more.
regard other: trust +1
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_lend
when concept=town.debt conv.db=lend
does react.self
say {da=give} Here. Don't make me ask for it back. | {da=give} I can spare a little. Not a lot. Here. | {da=give} Here's what I have on me. Restday, mind.
regard other: affinity +1
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_lend_cold
when concept=town.debt conv.db=lend self.warmth=cold
does react.self
say {da=refuse} I don't lend to friends. Keeps them friends. | {da=refuse} No. Sorry. No. | {da=refuse} Go to a moneylender. That's what they're for.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_lend_poor
when concept=town.debt conv.db=lend self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.self
say {da=none} I'm as #skint# as you are. | {da=none} I've three pennies. Want one? | {da=none} If I had it. You know I would.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_slate
when concept=town.debt conv.db=slate
does react.self
say {da=give} Just this week, mind. | {da=give} Go on. I'll write it down. | {da=give} Take it. Pay when you can.
regard other: affinity +1
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_slate_failing
when concept=town.debt conv.db=slate self.business=failing
does react.self
priority 1
say {da=refuse} I can't. I'm sorry. Half the street owes me already. | {da=refuse} If I give credit to one more, I'll be on somebody's slate myself. | {da=refuse} I'd love to. I can't. Look at my shelves.
then other: town.close

rule n7_da_slate_due
when concept=town.debt conv.db=slate_due
does react.self
say {da=promise} I'll pay Restday. Every penny. | {da=promise} I know. I'm sorry. Things are tight. | {da=promise} Can I work it off? I can sweep, carry, anything.
then other: town.close

## The last word on money and promises (conv.da says how it was taken)

rule n7_close_debt
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt
does ack
say #bc_right# | Well. We'll see. | Hm.

rule n7_close_debt_promise
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=promise
does ack
say Right. Restday, then. | I'll hold you to it. | Good. That's all I ask. | See that you do.

rule n7_close_debt_promise_warm
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=promise self.warmth=warm
does ack
say Don't lose sleep over it. | I know you will. | Good. Now, let's talk of something nicer.

rule n7_close_debt_plead
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=plead
does ack
say ...All right. Restday. Do your best. | Keep your coat. I'll wait. | We're both in a hole, then.

rule n7_close_debt_paid
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=paid
does ack
say Thank you. That's a weight off. | You're a good sort. | That'll see me through the week.

rule n7_close_debt_dodge
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=dodge
does ack
say Don't give me that. | I'll remember this. | Nice try. I'll be round Restday. | You know full well what you said.

rule n7_close_debt_bite
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=bite
does ack
say Hmph. Restday, then. And not a day after. | Don't take that tone with me. | Fine. I'll ask again tomorrow. And the day after.

rule n7_close_debt_ease
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=ease
does ack
say You're good to me. | Thank you. I'll not forget it. | I'll not keep you waiting long. | Restday. Truly.

rule n7_close_debt_stern
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=stern
does ack
say Restday. I swear. | I know. I know. | Gods, you'd have the pennies off a dead wolf's eyes.

rule n7_close_debt_deny
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=deny
does ack
say I hope that's so. | I'll judge for myself. | Then show me.

rule n7_close_debt_assure
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=assure
does ack
say Good. I may need you, then. | That's what I hoped to hear. | I'll come to you, then. Soon.

rule n7_close_debt_give
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=give
does ack
say Thank you. Truly. | You've saved me. | Restday. Every penny.

rule n7_close_debt_refuse
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=refuse
does ack
say Right. Forget I asked. | I understand. | I'll manage somehow.

rule n7_close_debt_none
when concept=town.close conv.on=debt conv.da=none
does ack
say I know. Thank you anyway. | Keep your pennies. | We'll muddle through, the pair of us.

## The people they deal with: their priest, their shopkeeper, their leader, their neighbour by name

rule n7_ro_priest_devout
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.priest self.piety=devout pair.flock=no
does ask.detail
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=priest} #self.priest# preached on charity last Restday. Half the front pews left early. | {on=answer ans=priest} #self.priest# blessed our door. I feel safer. Is that silly? | {on=answer ans=priest} Have you heard #self.priest# sing? Like a bell. A cracked bell, but a bell.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_priest_ordinary
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.priest self.piety=ordinary pair.flock=no
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=priest} #self.priest# caught me nodding off in chapel. Again. | {on=answer ans=priest} #self.priest# asked why I wasn't at chapel. I said my knees. My knees were at the tavern. | {on=answer ans=priest} #self.priest# went on for an hour last Restday. An hour!
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_to_priest
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.flock=b
does ask.detail
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=to_priest} Will it be a long sermon this Restday? Only my knees. | {on=answer ans=to_priest} I've been meaning to come and see you. About my sister. | {on=answer ans=to_priest} Bless me, would you? I've a feeling about this week.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_priest_to_flock
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.flock=a
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=flock} I've not seen you at chapel lately. | {on=answer ans=flock} How's your soul, these days? I ask everyone. Nobody answers. | {on=answer ans=flock} Come Restday. There's bread after, if nothing else.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_priest_to_flock_poor
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.flock=a other.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
priority 1
say {on=answer ans=flock_poor} There's bread at the chapel door after the bell. Come. No questions. | {on=answer ans=flock_poor} The poor box isn't only for putting in. You know that? | {on=answer ans=flock_poor} If the rent's the trouble, come and talk to me. The chapel has a little.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_shopkeeper_short
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.prices self.shopkeeper pair.customer=no
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=shop} #self.shopkeeper# gave me short weight again. I'm sure of it. | {on=answer ans=shop} Went to #self.shopkeeper#'s for candles. Came out with soap. Don't ask. | {on=answer ans=shop} #self.shopkeeper# never smiles. Not once in ten years.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_shopkeeper_kind
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.prices self.shopkeeper self.warmth=warm pair.customer=no
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=shopgood} #self.shopkeeper# kept a loaf back for me. Didn't even ask. | {on=answer ans=shopgood} #self.shopkeeper# let me off a penny. Said I'd an honest face. | {on=answer ans=shopgood} Say what you like about #self.shopkeeper#, #self.shopkeeper_they#'d give you the coat off #self.shopkeeper_their# back. Then charge you for the buttons.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_customer_ask
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.prices pair.customer=a
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=customer} Keep one back for me on Restday? | {on=answer ans=customer} Got any of the good stuff in? The stuff you keep under the counter? | {on=answer ans=customer} Put something by for me, would you? I'll be in tomorrow.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_customer_price
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.prices pair.customer=a
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=customer_price} Is it up again? The price? Don't tell me. | {on=answer ans=customer_price} What's it to be this week? Same as last, I pray. | {on=answer ans=customer_price} Tell me it's not gone up again.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_keeper_miss
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.prices pair.customer=b
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=keeper_miss} You've not been in this week. Found somewhere else? | {on=answer ans=keeper_miss} Not seen you in a while. I was starting to worry. | {on=answer ans=keeper_miss} You've gone off me, haven't you? Nine days without a visit.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_keeper_offer
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.prices pair.customer=b
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=keeper} Your usual's put by. Didn't even have to ask. | {on=answer ans=keeper} I've something new in. You'll want to see it. | {on=answer ans=keeper} Come by later. I've kept something back for you.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_leader
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.leader
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=leader} #self.leader#'s people were round counting doors. | {on=answer ans=leader} #self.leader# rode past this morning. Didn't look left or right. | {on=answer ans=leader} They say #self.leader# eats off silver every night. Every night!
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_leader_house
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.work self.leader self.house self.wealth!=rich
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=leader_house} #self.leader# wants the books by Restday. Every page. | {on=answer ans=leader_house} #self.leader# came down to the floor today. Everyone stood straighter. | {on=answer ans=leader_house} You don't argue with #self.leader#. You nod, and then you do it.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_neighbour_name
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.neighbour pair.neighbours=no
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=neighbour} #self.neighbour# next door's taken up the fiddle. Gods help me. | {on=answer ans=neighbour} #self.neighbour#'s been at the wall again with a hammer. What is #self.neighbour_they# building? | {on=answer ans=neighbour} #self.neighbour# knows everything about everyone on our row. Everything.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_ro_neighbour_kind
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.neighbour pair.neighbours=no self.warmth=warm
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=neighbourgood} #self.neighbour# brought round a pie when I was poorly. Good sort. | {on=answer ans=neighbourgood} Lucky with my neighbour. #self.neighbour# keeps an eye on the place when I'm late. | {on=answer ans=neighbourgood} #self.neighbour# and I share a wall and a stew-pot. Half each.
then other: town.answer

## The realm's figures, where they're known (empty until the table is filled)

rule n7_fg_ruler
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore world.figure_ruler
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=figure} They say #world.figure_ruler# means to raise the levy again. | {on=answer ans=figure} #world.figure_ruler# is to pass through, they say. They'll sweep the streets for once. | {on=answer ans=figure} Do you think #world.figure_ruler# even knows our town's name?
then other: town.answer

rule n7_fg_lord
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore world.figure_lord
does ask.detail
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=figure} #world.figure_lord# rode through with twenty riders. For what? | {on=answer ans=figure} #world.figure_lord#'s steward was in the market, buying up the best of everything. | {on=answer ans=figure} Our lord. #world.figure_lord#. Ever seen them? Me neither.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_fg_captain
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore|talk.crime world.figure_captain
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=figure} #world.figure_captain# has doubled the night watch. Something's up. | {on=answer ans=figure} They say #world.figure_captain# never sleeps. Just stands in a doorway and glares. | {on=answer ans=figure} #world.figure_captain# had a watchman flogged for drinking. Fair, I suppose.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_fg_high_priest
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore world.figure_high_priest
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=figure} #world.figure_high_priest# is to lead the prayers at the festival, they say. | {on=answer ans=figure} They say #world.figure_high_priest# fasts a whole week every winter. | {on=answer ans=figure} #world.figure_high_priest# wrote to every chapel. More candles, fewer excuses.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_fg_hero
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore world.figure_hero
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=hero} Every pup in the street wants to be #world.figure_hero# when they're grown. | {on=answer ans=hero} They sing about #world.figure_hero# in the tavern now. Badly. | {on=answer ans=hero} Did #world.figure_hero# really do all that? Or is it the songs?
then other: town.answer

rule n7_fg_villain
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore|talk.bandits world.figure_villain
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=villain} Lock up tonight. They say #world.figure_villain# has been seen on the roads. | {on=answer ans=villain} Mothers frighten their pups with #world.figure_villain# now. Works, too. | {on=answer ans=villain} If #world.figure_villain# ever comes here, I'm hiding in the well.
then other: town.answer

## The town's news, as it falls on each (world.*, newcomers, crime, news of their own)

rule n7_wd_wedding
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day world.wedding=recent
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=wedding} Another wedding. The chapel's never had it so good. | {on=answer ans=wedding} Did you hear the wedding? I think the whole town heard the wedding. | {on=answer ans=wedding} Weddings, weddings. Somebody'll be marrying me off next.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_wd_birth
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day world.birth=recent
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=birth} A new pup in town. You can hear it from the well. | {on=answer ans=birth} They've had the baby. A fine loud one, by the sound. | {on=answer ans=birth} Another mouth. Good. The town needs pups.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_wd_death
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day world.death=recent
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=death} The bell was going a long while yesterday. | {on=answer ans=death} Another one buried. The town feels thinner. | {on=answer ans=death} They say the whole street turned out for the burying. Good. That's how it should be.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_wd_festival_levy
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.festival world.festival=soon
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {on=answer ans=festival} They're paying for the festival lamps out of the levy, mind. | {on=answer ans=festival} They're putting up bunting in the good streets. Ours get the leftover string. | {on=answer ans=festival} Festival's coming. Every price in the market's gone up a paw's width already.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_wd_festival_poor
when concept=talk.festival|talk.smalltalk world.festival=today self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=festival} Feast for some, crumbs for the rest. | {on=answer ans=festival} Free ale till noon, they said. I've been here since dawn and seen none of it. | {on=answer ans=festival} I've no festival coat. I've a coat. It'll do.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_wd_festival_rich
when concept=talk.festival|talk.smalltalk world.festival=today self.wealth=rich
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=festival} Dreadful crush. One can't move for revellers. | {on=answer ans=festival} We gave for the lamps, you know. Half of them. | {on=answer ans=festival} My dressmaker's made me look like a cake. A festival cake. I'm told it's the fashion.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_nc_heights
when concept=talk.newcomer self.wealth=rich
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=newcomer} A newcomer? Where are they lodging? Not near us, I hope. | {on=answer ans=newcomer} #topic.subject#. Do we know the family? | {on=answer ans=newcomer} Is #topic.subject# anyone? I mean, anyone anyone?
then other: town.answer

rule n7_nc_warm
when concept=talk.newcomer self.warmth=warm
does tell.news
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=newcomer} We should take #topic.subject# something. A loaf. A pie. | {on=answer ans=newcomer} It's hard, being new. I'll call on #topic.subject# tomorrow. | {on=answer ans=newcomer} Someone should show #topic.subject# where the well is. And the honest baker.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_nc_neighbours
when concept=talk.newcomer pair.neighbours=yes
does tell.news
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=newcomer} #topic.subject#'s taking the empty place on our row. | {on=answer ans=newcomer} So we've a new neighbour. #topic.subject#. Heard #topic.them# unpacking at midnight. | {on=answer ans=newcomer} Have you met #topic.subject#? We'll hear #topic.them# through the wall soon enough.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_nc_guard
when concept=talk.newcomer self.role=guard
does tell.news
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=newcomer} I'll be keeping an eye on #topic.subject#. Nothing against #topic.them#. Habit. | {on=answer ans=newcomer} #topic.subject# came in through the gate with a cartload. Polite enough. | {on=answer ans=newcomer} New faces mean new trouble, nine times in ten. The tenth's all right.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_nc_old
when concept=talk.newcomer self.stage=old
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=newcomer} In my day you knew every face. Now look. #topic.subject#! Who's that? | {on=answer ans=newcomer} Another new one. Soon there'll be nobody I know. | {on=answer ans=newcomer} #topic.subject#. I'll learn the name, then #topic.they#'ll leave. Newcomers always leave.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_nc_merchant
when concept=talk.newcomer self.role=merchant
does tell.news
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=newcomer} A new customer, I hope. #topic.subject#. Has #topic.they# coin, do you know? | {on=answer ans=newcomer} I'll send #topic.subject# a little something. First purchase half price. Second, full. | {on=answer ans=newcomer} Every newcomer needs a pot, a broom and a blanket. I've all three.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_cr_lock
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft|assault self.business!=none
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {on=answer ans=crime} After #topic.victim#, I've put a second bar on the door. | {on=answer ans=crime} I'm sleeping in the back room till they've caught whoever did #topic.victim#. | {on=answer ans=crime} I've moved the takings since #topic.victim#. Don't ask me where.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_cr_parent
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft|assault self.parent=yes self.age<=45
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {on=answer ans=crime} After #topic.victim#, I've told the pups to come straight home. Straight home. | {on=answer ans=crime} The little ones keep asking about #topic.victim#. What do I tell them? | {on=answer ans=crime} I walked mine to the well this morning, after #topic.victim#. They thought I'd gone soft.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_cr_night
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft|assault here.time=dusk|night
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {on=answer ans=crime} I'll not walk home alone tonight, after #topic.victim#. | {on=answer ans=crime} Every shadow's somebody tonight. Poor #topic.victim#. | {on=answer ans=crime} Walk with me as far as the corner? Only after #topic.victim#...
then other: town.answer

rule n7_cr_arrest_short
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=arrest self.temper=short
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {on=answer ans=arrest} Good. Lock #topic.subject# up and lose the key. | {on=answer ans=arrest} About time the Watch earned their bread. | {on=answer ans=arrest} Hang them in the square, I say. Well. Lock them up.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_cr_arrest_warm
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=arrest self.warmth=warm
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {on=answer ans=arrest} Poor #topic.subject#. Whatever #topic.they# did, there's a family. | {on=answer ans=arrest} I knew #topic.subject#'s mother. She'll be heartbroken. | {on=answer ans=arrest} Arrested. Gods. I hope they're fed in there.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_nw_work_poor
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.news
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=goodnews} #topic.news#. Things are looking up, for once. | {on=answer ans=goodnews} #topic.news#. We'll eat properly this winter. | {on=answer ans=goodnews} #topic.news#. I could cry. I did cry, a little.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_nw_marriage_neighbours
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage pair.neighbours=yes
does tell.news
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=goodnews} #topic.news#. You'll have heard the wedding through the wall, I'm afraid. | {on=answer ans=goodnews} #topic.news#. There'll be one more of us on the row now. | {on=answer ans=goodnews} #topic.news#. There's cake left over. Come and help us with it.
then other: town.answer

rule n7_nw_crime_neighbours
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime pair.neighbours=yes self.role!=guard
does tell.news
cooldown 2d
say {on=answer ans=crime_me} #topic.news#. Right next door to you. Did you hear nothing? | {on=answer ans=crime_me} #topic.news#. Lock your door tonight. I mean it. | {on=answer ans=crime_me} #topic.news#. In our own street.
then other: town.answer

## Answering a remark about the town's people and news (self answers; conv.ans says what about; each
## remembers its stance, conv.aa: chat, glad, grave, ask, pup)

rule n7_aa_plain
when concept=town.answer
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Is that so. | {aa=chat} Hm. Sounds about right. | {aa=chat} Well, well. | {aa=chat} You don't say.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_plain2
when concept=town.answer
does react.self
say #agree#. | So I heard. | Mm.

rule n7_aa_priest
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=priest
does react.self
say {aa=chat} A good soul, all told. | {aa=chat} They mean well. They go on, but they mean well. | {aa=chat} You could do worse for a priest.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_priest_devout
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=priest self.piety=devout
does react.self
say {aa=chat} A good soul. We're lucky in our priest. | {aa=chat} I never miss a Restday. Not one in twenty years. | {aa=chat} It does you good, a sermon. Even a long one.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_priest_ordinary
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=priest self.piety=ordinary
does react.self
say {aa=chat} I go for the singing. And the bread after. | {aa=chat} I'll go Restday. Probably. Possibly. | {aa=chat} I keep meaning to go. Then it's Restday and I'm asleep.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_flock
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=flock
does react.self
say {aa=excuse} I've been meaning to come. My knees. | {aa=excuse} Restday. I'll be there. Near the back. | {aa=excuse} I know, I know. Work. Always work.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_flock_devout
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=flock self.piety=devout
does react.self
say {aa=chat} I'll be there. I've not missed one I could help. | {aa=chat} Bless you for asking. Truly. | {aa=chat} I've been praying at home. It's not the same, I know.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_flock_poor
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=flock_poor
does react.self
say {aa=glad} Thank you. I might. | {aa=glad} I'll not say no. Not this week. | {aa=glad} You're kind. I'll come by after the bell.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_flock_poor_proud
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=flock_poor self.warmth=cold
does react.self
say {aa=chat} We're managing. | {aa=chat} Give it to someone who needs it. | {aa=chat} I'll not take the chapel's bread.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_to_priest
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=to_priest
does react.self
say {aa=chat} An hour, no more. Bring a cushion. | {aa=chat} Come by the chapel after the bell. We'll talk. | {aa=chat} The Bright One keep you, and your knees.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_shop
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=shop
does react.self
say {aa=chat} They're all the same, shopkeepers. Thumb on the scale. | {aa=chat} Go elsewhere, then. Oh. There is nowhere else. | {aa=chat} Mine's worse. Mine sells me last week's bread at this week's price.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_shop_merchant
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=shop self.role=merchant
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Try running a shop. Every penny's argued over. | {aa=chat} Short weight? Never. Well. Not on purpose. | {aa=chat} We're not the enemy, #address#. The carters are.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_shopgood
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=shopgood
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Good sort, that one. | {aa=chat} You're lucky. Mine would charge you for the smile. | {aa=chat} Hold on to a shopkeeper like that.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_keeper_to_customer
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=customer
does react.self
say {aa=chat} For you, aye. I'll put it by. | {aa=chat} I'll see what I can do. | {aa=chat} I might. If you ask nicely.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_keeper_price
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=customer_price
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Up again, I'm afraid. It's the roads. | {aa=chat} Don't ask. I'll only cry. | {aa=chat} Not this week. Next week, maybe.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_keeper_failing
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=customer|customer_price self.business=failing
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Anything you want. Anything. Please. | {aa=chat} Name your price. Go on. Anything. | {aa=chat} You're the first through the door all day.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_customer_miss
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=keeper_miss
does react.self
say {aa=chat} I've been busy, that's all. | {aa=chat} Never! I'd not go anywhere else. | {aa=chat} Money's tight, that's all. It's not you.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_customer_reply
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=keeper
does react.self
say {aa=chat} I'll come by later. | {aa=chat} You know me too well. | {aa=chat} Go on, then. What is it?
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_customer_poor
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=keeper|keeper_miss self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Nothing for me this week. I'm #skint#. | {aa=chat} I've been going without. It's not you. | {aa=chat} I'll look. I'll not buy, but I'll look.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_leader
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=leader|leader_house|figure
does react.self
say {aa=chat} The great don't think of us. Why should we think of them? | {aa=chat} Their business. Not mine. | {aa=chat} I'd like a day in their boots. Just one.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_leader_poor
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=leader|figure self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Whatever it is, it'll cost us. | {aa=chat} Must be nice, being them. | {aa=chat} And not one of them's ever been down our street.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_leader_house
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=leader|leader_house self.house
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Careful. You're talking about the family. | {aa=chat} Stern, but fair. Mostly. | {aa=chat} I'd not say that where the steward can hear.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_figure_young
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=figure|hero self.stage=young|adolescent
does react.self
say {aa=pup} Have you seen them? Really seen them? | {aa=pup} I'm going to meet them one day. | {aa=pup} Are they tall? I bet they're tall.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_hero
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=hero
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Half of it's true. That's still a lot. | {aa=chat} Good. We could do with a few like that. | {aa=chat} I'd buy them a drink, if they ever came in.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_villain
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=villain
does react.self
say {aa=grave} Don't. I'll be up all night listening. | {aa=grave} Let them try it here. | {aa=grave} The Watch'll have them. Sooner or later.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_villain_young
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=villain self.stage=young|adolescent
does react.self
say {aa=pup} I'm not scared. I'm not. | {aa=pup} Would they eat me? | {aa=pup} I'd fight them. With a stick.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_neighbour
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=neighbour
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Every row has one. | {aa=chat} Better that than the other sort. | {aa=chat} Mine sings. At dawn. Every dawn.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_neighbourgood
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=neighbourgood
does react.self
say {aa=chat} You're lucky. Hold on to that one. | {aa=chat} A good neighbour's worth more than a good roof. | {aa=chat} Mine wouldn't lend me a candle.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_wedding
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=wedding|goodnews
does react.self
say {aa=glad} Good. There's not enough of that. | {aa=glad} Lovely. I do like good news. | {aa=glad} Here's to that.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_wedding_widowed
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=wedding self.widowed=yes
does react.self
say {aa=glad} Lovely. I was married in that chapel. A long time ago. | {aa=glad} Good. Let them be happy while they can. | {aa=glad} I went. Sat at the back. It was lovely.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_wedding_dry
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=wedding self.humour=dry
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Give it a year. | {aa=chat} Love's grand. So's a sound roof. | {aa=chat} Weddings: the town's way of getting a free meal out of you.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_birth
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=birth
does react.self
say {aa=glad} Good. The town needs pups. | {aa=glad} Loud ones are healthy, my mother said. | {aa=glad} Bless it. Bless the mother more.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_birth_parent
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=birth self.parent=yes
does react.self
say {aa=glad} They'll not sleep for a year. I remember. | {aa=glad} Lovely. I'll send round our old cradle. | {aa=glad} Ah. Enjoy it while they're small. They don't stay small.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_death
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=death
does react.self
say {aa=grave} It comes for us all. | {aa=grave} I'll go to the burying. | {aa=grave} The town'll be the poorer.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_death_mourning
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=death self.mourning=kin|friend
does react.self
priority 1
say {aa=grave} Don't. I've had my own this week. | {aa=grave} Every bell, I think it's for mine. | {aa=grave} I can't talk about burying. Not now.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_festival
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=festival
does react.self
say {aa=glad} Still. A festival's a festival. | {aa=glad} Ah, let them have their fun. Let us have ours. | {aa=glad} I'll dance anyway. Nobody can levy that.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_festival_merry
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=festival self.humour=merry
does react.self
say {aa=glad} I'll dance with you. I'll dance with anyone. | {aa=glad} Free ale? Did somebody say free ale? | {aa=glad} I've been practising my singing. Hide.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_newcomer
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=newcomer
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Give them a week. We'll see. | {aa=chat} Seems decent enough. | {aa=chat} New faces. The town needs them.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_newcomer_cold
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=newcomer self.warmth=cold
does react.self
say {aa=chat} I'll wait and see. | {aa=chat} Newcomers come and go. | {aa=chat} Let them prove themselves.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_newcomer_incomer
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=newcomer self.from=frosthollow|coldwater|oakhaven|mirebridge|fenshore|larkfield|southmeadow|saltwell here.region=ridgemere
does react.self
say {aa=chat} I was new once. Nobody brought me a pie. | {aa=chat} Be kind. I remember my first winter here. | {aa=chat} They'll learn. Took me three years to stop getting lost.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_crime
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=crime
does react.self
say {aa=grave} Lock your doors. I'm locking mine. | {aa=grave} It's getting worse. Every season. | {aa=grave} Nobody's safe. Not even in the good streets.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_crime_guard
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=crime|crime_me self.role=guard
does react.self
say {aa=grave} We're on it. Give us a day. | {aa=grave} I'll ask about. Someone always saw something. | {aa=grave} Tell your street: anything odd, come to the Watch.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_crime_sump
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=crime self.quarter=sump here.region=ridgemere
does react.self
say {aa=grave} And they'll come knocking down our way. You'll see. | {aa=grave} Never the Heights they search. Never. | {aa=grave} Wasn't us. It's never us. Somehow it's always us.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_crime_nervy
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=crime|crime_me self.temper=nervy
does react.self
say {aa=grave} I'll not sleep tonight. | {aa=grave} I've put a chair against my door. Two chairs. | {aa=grave} What if they come back? What if they come to ours?
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_crime_me
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=crime_me
does react.self ask.detail
say {aa=ask} Gods! Are you hurt? | {aa=ask} What did they take? | {aa=ask} I'm so sorry. Did you see them?
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_arrest
when concept=town.answer conv.ans=arrest
does react.self
say {aa=grave} What did they do, do you know? | {aa=grave} They'll be out by Restday, I'd bet. | {aa=grave} The gaol's no place to get better.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_dry
when concept=town.answer self.humour=dry conv.ans=shop|neighbour|leader|figure|festival|newcomer|hero
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Riveting. | {aa=chat} The town never sleeps. Worse luck. | {aa=chat} And the world keeps turning.
then other: town.close

rule n7_aa_merry
when concept=town.answer self.humour=merry conv.ans=shop|neighbour|leader|figure|festival|wedding|newcomer|goodnews|birth|hero
does react.self
say {aa=chat} Ha! This town. | {aa=chat} Never a dull day. | {aa=chat} You do hear things, don't you!
then other: town.close

## The last word on the town's people and news (conv.aa says how it was taken)

rule n7_close_ans
when concept=town.close conv.on=answer
does ack
say Aye. Well. That's the town. | So it goes. | Hm. We'll see. | There's always something.

rule n7_close_ans_grave
when concept=town.close conv.on=answer conv.aa=grave
does ack
priority 1
say Aye. Bad times. | Gods keep us. | Strange times. | Mind how you go.

rule n7_close_ans_glad
when concept=town.close conv.on=answer conv.aa=glad
does ack
say Good times, for once. | We'll drink to it. | Something to smile about.

rule n7_close_ans_excuse
when concept=town.close conv.on=answer conv.aa=excuse
does ack
say I'll hold you to that. | Near the back's still in the chapel. | I'll keep a place for you.

rule n7_close_ans_ask
when concept=town.close conv.on=answer conv.aa=ask
does ack
say I'm all right. Shaken, that's all. | Everything I had on me. | It was too dark. I'd not know them again. | I'll live. That's the main thing.

rule n7_close_ans_pup
when concept=town.close conv.on=answer conv.aa=pup
does ack
say Maybe one day. | Ha. You and every pup in town. | Off you go, now.
